1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,500
Good evening, everyone.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Did anyone feed the dog?

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,500
[moaning]

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,500
The train is running late again.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Where did you put the map?

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,500
It was on the kitchen table.

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,500
Oh, crap. Damn it.

8
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,500
Look, the lake is frozen.

9
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,000
Can we stop for hot chocolate?

10
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,500
[kissing]

11
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,500
Tell me the story about the lighthouse.

12
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,500
Remember to call your aunt.
